  "description": {
   "en": "All things have spirituality. Those with high comprehension and strong talent can absorb the primal yang and yin energies of heaven and earth to strengthen themselves—these beings are known as Spirits. Spirits use their innate talent, combined with primal yang or yin energy, to channel the power of heaven and earth—this is called Spiritual Arts.\n\nWang Ze, the sole heir of the Wang family bloodline, possesses an exceptionally high talent as a Spiritual Being. Under the guidance of his great-grandfather, he experiences his first awakening and steps into the world of Spirits…"
  },
